  "releaseNotes": "0.1.6: Adds [ToolDomain] — domain-level description/when_to_use/when_not_to_use are now emitted in the tools/list manifest, so a consumer can choose between domains by prose instead of by role name. Declared on the class owning the domain's tools; omitting it emits the same manifest as before. In sync with scxp (Python) 0.1.6. Supports SCXP protocol version 1.",
